{"resourceIdentifier":"2099","resourceName":"Ningbo Yinzhou Landfill Gas Recovery and Utilization Project","description":"Ningbo Yinzhou Landfill Gas Recovery and Utilization Project (hereafter referred to as the project) is located at Ningbo Yinzhou landfill in Bailiang village, Dongqiao town, Yinzhou district, Ningbo city, Zhejiang province, P.R China.The main objective of the project is to collect landfill gas, which consists mainly of methane, and to generate electricity using the methane by installing an LFG collection system, electricity generation system and an LFG flaring system on site. Project started construction in October 2010 and started operation on 8th November 2011. The project will achieve annual average amount of feed-in electricity of 9,742MWh and annual average emission reduction of 88,139tCO2e during the fixed 10 years crediting period.","location":{"latitude":29.751900,"longitude":121.389600},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":null,"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2099"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Yinzhou district, Ningbo city, Zhejiang Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Ningbo Micropowers New Energy Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Late to verify"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2099"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"88139"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0001"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"LGAI Technological Center, S.A. (Applus+ Certification)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"16/06/2020"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"